Apparently Cybergladiators has a bug in it that when getting to the
third level the game will hang with any 3d accelerator card that has
bilinear filtering enabled.

The fix is simply to turn the filtering on.  With the PowerVR you use
its own utility, and with the 3Dfx you can use tweek.

I'm not sure about the others.

If this helps anyone you can thank Jack at 3D Gaming
http://www.3dgaming.com  great information and screenshots on anything
that is 3D.



